gh, and difficulty breathing for 3 days.&quot;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&#10;            &lt;div class=&quot;inline-actions&quot;&gt;&#10;              &lt;button id=&quot;predictButton&quot; class=&quot;primary-button&quot; type=&quot;button&quot;&gt;Predict Conditions&lt;/button&gt;&#10;              &lt;span id=&quot;predictStatus&quot; class=&quot;status-text&quot;&gt;Uses lightweight symptom scoring for deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;            &lt;/div&gt;&#10;          &lt;/div&gt;&#10;          &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&#10;            &lt;h3&gt;Prediction Results&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;            &lt;div id=&quot;predictionResults&quot; class=&quot;stack-list empty-state&quot;&gt;Enter symptoms to see possible conditions.&lt;/div&gt;&#10;          &lt;/div&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;panel-phq9&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;div class=&quot;panel-head&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;div&gt;&#10;            &lt;p class=&quot;panel-kicker&quot;&gt;Validated Screening&lt;/p&gt;&#10;            &lt;h2&gt;PHQ-9 Depression Assessment&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;          &lt;/div&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;        &lt;div class=&quot;grid-two&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&#10;            &lt;p class=&quot;section-copy&quot;&gt;Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by the following problems?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;            &lt;form id=&quot;phq9Form&quot; class=&quot;question-list&quot;&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&#10;            &lt;div class=&quot;inline-actions&quot;&gt;&#10;              &lt;button id=&quot;phq9Submit&quot; class=&quot;primary-button&quot; type=&quot;button&quot;&gt;Calculate Score&lt;/button&gt;&#10;              &lt;button id=&quot;phq9Reset&quot; class=&quot;ghost-button&quot; type=&quot;button&quot;&gt;Reset&lt;/button&gt;&#10;            &lt;/div&gt;&#10;          &lt;/div&gt;&#10;          &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&#10;            &